    "title": "FUNCTION-DocTest-List Rideshare Rides Historys-v5-spec",
    "description": "The Rideshare Rides History API provides access to a user's previous rides within the rideshare service. This API allows consumers to retrieve a detailed history of rides, including timestamps, distances, and fare amounts. It is particularly useful for both riders and service providers to analyze patterns, generate reports, or verify trip details. Typical use cases include auditing ride data and reviewing past journeys for expense management or personal tracking.",
